1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
It was going to cost them a fortune.

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:05,000
And I said, and wait till you see the overruns.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,360
Well, I turned out to be right.

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,980
They had massive cost overruns

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:12,900
and spent between $2 and $4 billion on the building

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,900
and did not even get the marble floors that I promised them.

